## Open Questions
skipAutoPermissionPrompt is not documented on the official settings reference
page and is not in the published claude-code-settings.json JSON schema. Its
behavior was never confirmed, only guessed from its name next to
skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt. It has now been removed. /config in a live
session is the authoritative source for keys missing from the public docs.

Auto mode becomes the default permission mode for new sessions on Pro, Max, and
Team plans starting 2026-08-14, per the permission-modes docs. An explicitly set
defaultMode takes precedence, so this commit's value wins either way.
